=== Document Q&A Assistant ===

Q: How many vacation days do I get?
A: According to the document, you accrue 15 days of PTO (Paid Time Off) per year.

Q: When does health insurance start?
A: According to the document, health benefits (medical, dental, vision coverage) start after 30 days.

Q: What's the remote work policy?
A: According to the document, the remote work policy is:

**Hybrid schedule** - 3 days in office, 2 days remote. Full remote requires manager approval.



